    "summary": "The email bears on GOOGL and NVDA, though the company on the call, Tessaral Test Systems (TSTS), is not one of the five. Greywell Securities is offering one of five client slots on a Wednesday 7:30-8:00am ET call with TSTS management after its pre-announcement. The call is to cover AI accelerator test demand, split between custom ASIC and GPU-class orders. The sender's own read links ASIC demand to Google's TPU line and raises questions about rack-level test needs for Nvidia's newest systems.",
    "why_attention": "Attending gives the desk direct access to management on test demand for custom ASIC and GPU programs, which may bear on Google and Nvidia. Only five slots exist, management is about to travel, and confirmation closes at a stated time. The Google link comes from the sender's supply-chain work, not from the company.",
    "action": "attend",
    "follow_up": "The analysts covering GOOGL and NVDA should reply to confirm a slot by 5pm on the day the email was sent, then join the call on Wednesday at 7:30am ET.",
    "deadline": "2026-10-13T17:00:00",
